  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 694925d99107355428ee965f7b9638b1, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Clover.Runtime::Clover.World.StoneCard
  ShowWithin: 1.1
  LineLength: 38
  Words: 'NIGHT PALE (Dark, the ''ring'' form)

    A ring closes round you and the enemy you face. Nothing crosses it, and it bites what touches it.

    Press use (E) to wear it. Hold Triangle (U) to cast. 35 mana.

    Mana comes back by itself while a stone''s spell is worn.'
  thing: {fileID: 1712269124}
  text: {fileID: 2020427394}
  back: {fileID: 1145812177}
  shown: {fileID: 1845360874}
  lineHeight: 0.17
